{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-02",
  "title": "低下头",
  "storyCode": "10-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "44652b0c909e75f9562352a1fa5dc429e402bc2a67db9041e423831a7c865d7c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "阿米娅，这样下去，托马斯先生又会落到深池的人手里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们是不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这帮烦人精！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我这就去把人捞回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "干嘛抓着我？这人不是我们救回来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "情况不同。我们不能让推进之王暴露在这些敌人面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你让我们把人丢了不管？这可不是我们格拉斯哥帮的作风！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们两个，别在这里吵架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "维娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......听博士和阿米娅的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "狙击干员，瞄准挟持目标的敌人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那个术师是关键。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "术师......\n博士，我想起来了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "根据Misery的消息和风笛的报告，她就是伦蒂尼姆这支深池部队的头目。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......也是小丘郡事件的始作俑者之一。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "罗德岛并不打算把Outcast的牺牲完全怪罪在她一个人头上，但不光Misery和风笛，我们许多干员都对她抱有强烈的敌意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "蔓德拉。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "风笛说，她很难缠。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们可以在这里和深池作战，救回托马斯先生，甚至排除蔓德拉这个对之后的行动有重大威胁的劲敌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "萨卡兹士兵来了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......来不及了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "各小组注意，继续隐藏自己的位置——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "做好随时战斗的准备。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......这边怎么回事？闹哄哄的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哦，我当是谁，原来是你们这些叛国者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "别用那个词。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们和维多利亚没关系了，魔族。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那——又是谁允许你对我们用这个称呼了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呵......一群被驱逐的乌合之众，只不过是趁着混乱占了别人的城市，就妄想自己是伦蒂尼姆的主人了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哈哈，你以为我跟你们似的，真在乎什么伦蒂尼姆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这里是挺干净亮堂的，对吧？也没什么死亡带来的臭气。但要我说，这座城市还不如变成废墟之后才更顺眼些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "萨卡兹在这里，只是因为魔王在这里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......魔王？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他们说的是特雷西斯？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "摄政王终于忍不住给自己加冕了？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......我们还没收到与之相关的情报。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "只是，无数情报指向一个已知的事实，曾经遍布泰拉的萨卡兹战士正在往伦蒂尼姆聚集，而且受到召集的不止有我们熟悉的普通雇佣兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "一些更古老的......更强大的力量正盘桓在这座城市的中心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "博士，我能感觉到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "在来到这附近以后，随着我们一步步走近，那些流进我心底......也缠绕在我思绪里的情感躁动了起来，它们正在变得更加强烈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你还好吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我没事，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "只是......在刚才那一瞬间......我好像......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "在听到这些萨卡兹战士称呼“君主”的时候，那些情感......中的一缕，它弹跳了起来，轻轻抓了我一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我不知道该如何更确切地形容这种感受......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们需要谈谈。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我也愿意花更多时间与博士交谈......可不能是现在。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "即便真的有一位......萨卡兹的君主控制着如今的伦蒂尼姆，这也不会改变我们的使命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们来这里，是为了阻止一场战争。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们要弄清楚他们正在做什么，最终又准备做什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——这与特雷西斯为自己选择什么称谓没有关系。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "所以，我们裹尸布似的又臭又长的相互问候结束了吗，深池？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "把你们抓着的这个人交出来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "凭什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "就凭我们管着你祖上老家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "住手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "长官......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不光是你。萨卡兹，我也在叫你住手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我知道你，菲林，你是他们的指挥官。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但我为什么要听你的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "因为我曾经去过圣王会西部大堂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哈哈，我们都听说了，你想见殿下，但殿下叫人把你赶了出来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你还真以为你在萨卡兹眼里算个什么东西？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "长官，我们凭什么要受这些魔族的侮辱？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我受不了了，自从来了伦蒂尼姆，我们天天要在这些劣等种......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "别说了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们明明可以回去找领袖......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我叫你别说了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "萨卡兹，无论你怎么激我，我都不会从这里离开。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们是萨卡兹的客人，这是你们的殿下还有殿下近臣亲口承认过的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你真想知道我们萨卡兹是如何对待不听话的“客人”的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那我们之中至少有一方还懂点礼貌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们答应了你们的王和将军，深池的部队不会踏足伦蒂尼姆中央城区。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "与此同时，你们也不该在这拦住我，萨卡兹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "还是说你们魔族从来就背信弃义，不知道“守约”两个字怎么写？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呵，徒有其表的菲林......我没在这里砍死你，不是因为我得了什么命令要跟你们做朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要是一个萨卡兹吵着架就忘了目标是什么，那他一定早就死在了战场之外的酒吧里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们是来这追查一些不听话的阴沟虫豸的，这些不自量力的小东西眼下就躲在附近，给我们的工作四处添乱——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "听起来，萨卡兹要找的也不是托马斯先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "难道是信使女士提到过的，能为我们的行动提供帮助的朋友？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "如果是他们的话，的确会被萨卡兹当作敌人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要是他们真的就在这里，我们或许能帮他们一把......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "人群停止移动了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我听见了争执声......萨卡兹士兵和什么人起了冲突。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "中尉，我看到了那些人的制服......是深池！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......是她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "您是说那个深池的术师？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "她......她很可怕......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们之中好几个人死在她手里。她会把人串在不知从哪冒出来的石柱上，她的手段比萨卡兹还狠！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "中尉，您也对付过她？瞧我说的......您从深池手里救了这么多人，您一定击败过她......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我输了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那您......您从她手里活了下来，这已经很了不起了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我不清楚为何她没有立刻杀了我......我有过一些猜想。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "在伦蒂尼姆外的军营里，我察觉到他们与一位伯爵的信使有过数次秘密会面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我想，这信息是她有意透露给我的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......又或许并不是她。她那样的人，无从获知我的祖父与那位伯爵的父亲曾是亲密战友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "而伯爵本人......如果我没有记错的话，他曾是一位公爵的扈从。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "中尉......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "抱歉，我不该在你们面前说这些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我有很长一段时间躲在城市的......暗处，习惯了与无法开口的水道磐蟹为伍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那些时候，我不必在意自己话语的回音是否会给别人蒙上阴翳。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我只是需要把有些话说出来，以免自己忘记。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "中尉，我不是阻拦您开口的意思！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我甚至希望您能多说一些，我早就想知道，到底是谁高高在上地操控着这一切，把我们害成这样！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我脑海中的那位公爵，他此刻并不在伦蒂尼姆。甚至说......他似乎从未属意过这城中空置的王座。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "如果他就是深池背后的支持者，那么很多问题都有了解答，可与此同时，我们眼前的危局也将更难解......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "听好。无论我之前说了什么，都还只是一些不成形的猜测。你们还想听的话，我们可以换个场合。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......只要你们到时候依然愿意跟随我踏进阴影里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那现在呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "现在——我们需要找到一个脱身的时机。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "深池一直想从萨卡兹手里找到什么，或许是一个或者几个人，所以才在萨迪恩区建了那么多处据点。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "除了像你们这样被萨卡兹追捕的士兵，他们还抓走了很多与萨卡兹有关的平民。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不管蔓德拉到底有什么目的......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "只要深池和萨卡兹发生冲突，对我们都是有利的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "听起来您已经有一个计划了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "罗本，我给你的手弩你有没有好好藏在袖子里？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "当然，中尉！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "瞄准离萨卡兹最近的那个深池士兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "看样子，深池不会后退。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "萨卡兹的耐心很有限，他们之间的冲突一触即发。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "博士，我们要启动备用计划了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喂，把你们手里的人交出来，要不然就老实点死在我们手上——给彼此一个痛快，不好吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......长官，我们是不是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我不明白......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我说不行就是不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哪怕这会导致我们和萨卡兹关系破裂？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你听到他们的话了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我们......什么时候做过朋友？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这才对嘛，这可是你说的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——列队！围住这些深池软蛋！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这个人，深池非要不可。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "实在带不走他的话，我们只能在这里杀了他。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呜啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "闭嘴，吵死了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要不然把这几个萨卡兹也都杀了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是不是该轮到我们登场了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "等一下，空中坐标还在校准。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你看啊，再不动手的话，那个人就要被杀了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "马上......直线距离十七米......十六米......十五米......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "最好再近一点，不然你很难瞄准吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不行呀，再靠近会被发现的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "听我的，绝对不会失败，不然我把头给你当钉子敲——你让它往东偏一点，刚好光线反射会遮掉机翼......\n好了，就是现在！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——洛克五号，攻击！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是时候了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "号角",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "罗本，动手！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呃呃呃——啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "唔呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你们暗算我们？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "说什么呢？先放暗箭的难道不是你们——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "还击！还击！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "染上萨卡兹血的人，只能用更多的血来偿还！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "在这里的人，一个都别放过！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "记住，是你们先动的手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——上吧，杀了所有在场的萨卡兹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不能让他们活着回去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "今天在这里发生的一切，绝不能让领头的魔族知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊啊啊啊——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "救命，救命！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "阿米娅，这些平民无处可逃......不光托马斯先生，前面好多人都还在他们的交战范围里！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "萨卡兹和深池都不会管平民的死活！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "博士，阿米娅，抱歉，我不能就这么看着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......我做不到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没有其他选择了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "全体干员注意，行动目标——变更！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "非作战人员继续保持隐蔽，作战人员在保证安全的情况下，救人！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......有箭从后面射过来？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是那些穿着平民衣服的人......他们携带着违禁武器！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不对劲，升降梯那里还躲着更多敌人！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哈......我们抓到那群虫豸的尾巴了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这里果然有反抗军——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "立刻去通报曼弗雷德将军！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
